1
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,010
Done with the medicine.

2
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:49,040
You should head back now.

3
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,610
It's not safe this late.

4
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,280
If it's not safe,

5
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:55,400
shouldn't I stay?

6
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:03,880
No way. I only have one bed.

7
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,920
I know.

8
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,480
It's not like we haven't shared it before.

9
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,520
Actually, I have a sleep disorder,

10
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,810
but I slept really well that night.

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,200
Are you my human sleeping pill?

12
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:21,600
Just go.

13
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,600
Maybe I should just take you back.

14
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,600
I came all this way to bring you medicine,

15
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:30,130
and this is how you treat me?

16
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:38,720
How about I treat you to dinner
after class tomorrow?

17
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:43,759
Fine. It's rare for you to invite me out.

18
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,400
See you tomorrow.

19
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:56,880
Qingqing,

20
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,520
is this yours?

21
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:03,040
Tangbao just jumped out
from the edge of the clouds

22
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,400
with this in its mouth.

23
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,800
This is my bracelet.

24
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,960
Huohuo, is this your puppy?

25
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,560
Yeah.

26
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:11,600
It couldn't find its mom
on the tea mountain,

27
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,400
so I brought it home.

28
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,810
Its name is Tangbao.

29
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:17,120
Tangbao.

30
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:21,079
Tangbao, you can't be a thief dog.

31
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,880
Please forgive it.

32
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:25,079
Tangbao loves shiny things.

33
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,079
How could I be mad at it?

34
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:30,320
How did this little thing get here
and cause trouble?

35
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,680
It's fine.

36
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,560
I kept this bracelet in a box.

37
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,840
I don't know how it got it out.

38
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,570
As long as it didn't swallow it.

39
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:44,850
Tangbao eats the center of the melon,
and Huohuo eats the edges.

40
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,160
So cute.

41
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,010
Why are you still wearing this?

42
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,210
What did you say?

43
00:02:54,079 --> 00:02:54,880
The bracelet.

44
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,760
My ex actually gave this to me.

45
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:02,560
Normally, I should have gotten rid of it
after we broke up,

46
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,200
but I heard it's quite expensive.

47
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:04,840
I figured

48
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,560
if I ever end up broke,

49
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,640
I might be able to sell it secondhand

50
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:09,560
for some food.

51
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,040
Your ex gave it to you?

52
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:12,520
Which one?

53
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,680
An ex is an ex.

54
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,360
You don't know him anyway.

55
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,280
I clearly gave this to you.

56
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,960
Are you kidding me?

57
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:25,040
Do you think I'd joke about this?

58
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:28,440
Do you still remember
how you got this bracelet?

59
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:11,760
No wonder Zhang Yi insisted you come.

60
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,080
He wanted to show off in front of you.

61
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:17,720
Qingqing,

62
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,480
are you still playing the puzzle game

63
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,720
with that 2847?

64
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:23,280
This is the last piece of the puzzle.

65
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,680
He made a wish in advance,

66
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:25,760
saying he wanted to meet me.

67
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,090
What are you going to do?

68
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,920
Are you meeting your online friend
in person?

69
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,180
Just an online friend.

70
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:32,720
A normal meetup with an online friend.

71
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,680
You're such a super beauty.

72
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,120
Meeting him in person,

73
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,680
that guy hit the jackpot, okay?

74
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,760
What if he's a

75
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,240
300-pound glutton?

76
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,520
No way.

77
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:45,720
I've heard his voice messages.
He sounds pretty good.

78
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,640
Fat compresses the vocal cords.

79
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:50,720
The best boyish voices usually belong
to guys over 200 pounds.

80
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,720
Girl,

81
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,280
we're not doing anything.

82
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:57,280
What does his weight have to do with me?

83
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:58,520
We're just meeting as online friends.

84
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:00,840
Just a meetup.

85
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,360
Stop talking nonsense.

86
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,280
Look, look, look.

87
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,280
There's a handsome guy over there.

88
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:09,720
Baby,

89
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:12,520
stay right here. I'll be right back.

90
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,720
Tangtang.

91
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:43,120
What's going on? A power outage?

92
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,080
Qingqing!

93
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,380
Thanks. Thank you.

94
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,000
That scared me to death.

95
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,480
Hey, I'm fine now.

96
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,180
You can let go of me now.

97
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:01,440
Hey, who are you?

98
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,960
Let me go. Let me go! Let me go!

99
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:09,880
Qingqing!

100
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:11,120
Jialing!

101
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,760
Qingqing, are you okay?

102
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,960
Looks like there was
a circuit problem just now.

103
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:16,920
I'm fine.

104
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:19,360
Qingqing, did you see Shen Feng?

105
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,000
Shen Feng?

106
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,600
I don't know him.

107
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,360
I told you about him before.

108
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,760
The math genius

109
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:27,090
who's really handsome.

110
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,320
Zhang Yi?

111
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:31,080
How would we know a big shot like him?

112
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,280
Did you tell me?

113
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:35,159
Qingqing, do you like this bracelet?

114
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:37,960
What do you mean?

115
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:39,420
You gave me this bracelet?

116
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,720
So you were the one
who caught me just now?

117
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,640
Yes, I was afraid you'd fall.

118
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:45,320
T-This bracelet is too expensive.

119
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:45,760
I can't accept it.

120
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:47,220
It's not expensive at all.

121
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:49,960
I just thought it suited you.

122
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,520
As long as you like it.

123
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:54,680
But I told you before,

124
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,659
I don't want to date right now.

125
00:06:58,320 --> 00:06:59,080
I'm sorry.

126
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,960
Let's go.

127
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:06,000
Qingqing, I can wait for you.

128
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,240
I'll always wait.

129
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,800
So you were the one

130
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:14,280
who put the bracelet on me in the dark

131
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,560
that night?

132
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,320
I didn't expect

133
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,280
your ex

134
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,920
to claim credit for my gift.

135
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:25,600
You really keep your mouth shut,
don't you?

136
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:28,200
Why didn't you tell me
you gave me the bracelet?

137
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:30,280
I wanted to tell you.

138
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,120
But someone blocked me.

139
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:34,600
I even went to your dorm

140
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:37,400
and saw you hugging your ex.

141
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,740
And you even announced it on Moments.

142
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,920
Since we dated,

143
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,300
I didn't want to say it.

144
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,320
Actually, Zhang Yi posted
that announcement

145
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:53,600
on my phone without asking.

146
00:07:53,960 --> 00:07:56,159
Also, we weren't hugging.

147
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,280
He suddenly hugged me,

148
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:58,880
and I couldn't push him away.

149
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,360
Why would you be with

150
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,240
a guy like that?

151
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:07,520
He might have his flaws,

152
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:08,960
but back then,

153
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,730
he treated me incredibly well.

154
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:13,160
He knew exactly

155
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,880
what I wanted

156
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,240
and how I felt

157
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,640
without me saying a word.

158
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:21,720
It's hard not to fall for

159
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:24,160
someone so attentive and understanding.

160
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,960
He even took credit for a gift.

161
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:28,010
That shows his poor character.

162
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,480
Your relationship was built on

163
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,720
deceit.

164
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,200
No wonder it didn't last.

165
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,840
It was my fault for mistaking
who the gift was from.

166
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:39,840
It took a while,

167
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:42,159
but at least
the misunderstanding is cleared up.

168
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:43,840
This bracelet is so valuable...

169
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,370
I'd better return it to you.

170
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,320
I already gave it to you.

171
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,780
There's no taking it back.

172
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,700
Just keep it on.

173
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:56,540
Let's have some melon and make up.

174
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:01,720
Hello.

175
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,320
Do you have a table for two

176
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:05,490
at 6:00 tonight?

177
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,480
Okay. My last name is Yue.

178
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,200
What's wrong?

179
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,970
Aren't you happy to see Mom?

180
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,480
Didn't I tell you?

181
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:24,240
If you need anything,
just wait for me at home.

182
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,280
You didn't have to come.

183
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,440
Mom forgot again.

184
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,280
I saw it was time to eat,

185
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,040
so I brought you

186
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:31,040
your favorite yam and pork rib soup.

187
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:34,520
I'm allergic to yams.

188
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:41,200
Right, right, right.
This is Yingying's favorite.

189
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,240
I'm getting old,

190
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,640
and my memory is failing.

191
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:48,640
What do you want?

192
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,640
Nothing major.

193
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:56,160
I just want to discuss something with you.

194
00:09:57,560 --> 00:09:58,560
You know

195
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,360
my health hasn't been good

196
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,360
since that serious illness.

197
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:06,720
The doctor also told me
to recuperate well.

198
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,040
A couple of days ago,

199
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,560
Aunt Qian went to
a newly opened nursing home

200
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:12,160
and said it was quite good.

201
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:14,920
She kept urging me to go with her

202
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:17,120
for half a month to keep her company.

203
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,680
Sometimes I think

204
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:28,960
I should have just died back then,

205
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:31,660
so I wouldn't be a burden
to you and Yingying.

206
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:36,720
How much?

207
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,160
38,800.

208
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:40,560
That's the price for
good nursing homes nowadays.

209
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:42,480
And this one is newly opened.

210
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,520
It has a good environment, good equipment,

211
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:46,650
and professional doctors and nurses.

212
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:53,720
I don't have to go.

213
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:56,960
I know you're having a hard time,
and I don't want to drag you down.

214
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:57,960
This price

215
00:10:58,320 --> 00:11:00,920
isn't something our family
can afford anyway.

216
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,880
Hello, Yingying.

217
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:10,320
I'm at your brother's.

218
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,080
I'm not going. I'm not going.

219
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,920
How can I spend your money?

220
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,640
Enough.

221
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,650
I'll transfer it to you.

222
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:59,320
Let's go. I'm hungry.

223
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:00,920
I'm sorry.

224
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,080
I can't go.

225
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,200
Why?

226
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:12,680
You can treat me to anything.

227
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:15,520
What are the local snacks around here?

228
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:16,780
Recommend something.

229
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,440
You don't have to accommodate me

230
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:20,300
by going to places you'd never go.

231
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:21,560
What do you mean?

232
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,320
I'm not some upper-class person.

233
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:26,050
So you're classifying
yourself as lower-class?

234
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,760
People are divided into different classes.

235
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:29,560
We are not

236
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,090
from the same world anyway.

237
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:32,560
We won't have a future.

238
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,360
Sorry.

239
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:35,600
I only live in the moment.

240
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,360
I don't care at all if you have money.

241
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,720
It's enough that I have money.

242
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,920
Well? Are you over it?

243
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,250
Can we get in the car now?

244
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,850
You will never understand.

245
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,090
I don't understand?

246
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:49,410
What exactly is causing your pain?

247
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:52,480
You're in pain

248
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,480
because every time we go out,
you sit in the passenger seat.

249
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,040
Every time we eat, I pay the bill.

250
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:58,760
One of my dresses costs
half a year of your salary.

251
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:01,560
In your mind, men are naturally
supposed to be superior to women.

252
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:03,800
But you're poor,
and it hurts your male ego.

253
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:05,800
That's what you're agonizing over.

254
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:11,120
But at least I know my place.
